From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 11:59:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 03/15] S2-4b step 3: Shooting Gallery at 30 on the GBA (tent
 and counter bands, the water as strip stamps, cards, wraith, Tix, weapons,
 bulbs and the weapon's name as stamps)

BACKDROP_STRIP (a stamp that may touch the side edges), the blob header checked once.
Gallery GBA drawn fps 11.0 / 10.5 (logic 19.4) -> 30 / 30 (logic 30), work 85 -> 29.7 ms.
Frames identical to the plain draw but for a shaken frame (the display offset, GBA only).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
